abstract: >-
  An end-to-end natural language processing system for classifying AG News
  articles into World, Sports, Business, and Sci/Tech categories. The project
  covers exploratory data analysis, text preprocessing, Bag-of-Words and
  TF-IDF feature extraction, classical machine-learning model comparison,
  calibrated LinearSVC inference, and a Flask web application.

